1	YEPD broth	Yeast extract peptone dextrose	Peptone 20g/L, Yeast extract 10 g/L, Dextrose 20g/L, Distilled water 1L. Heat with stirring to boiling to dissolve the medium completely. Autoclave the liquid medium at 121°C for 15 minutes. This medium supports the growth of most heterotrophic microorganisms but due to it simple composition, it has been adopted as the basal media for the routine cultivation of yeasts.
2	YEPD Agar	Yeast extract peptone dextrose	Peptone 20g/L, Yeast extract 10 g/L, Dextrose 20g/L, agar 15g/L, Distilled water 1L. Heat with stirring to boiling for 1 minute to dissolve the medium completely. Autoclave the medium at 121°C for 15 minutes.
\.
