2	NA	Nutrient Agar	Nutrient agar powder 28 g (lab-lemco powder 1 g, yeast extract 2 g, peptone 5 g, NaCl 5 g, agar 15g), distilled water 1 liter, heat the mixture while stirring to fully dissolve all components. Autoclave at 121 °C for 15 minutes.	1
