4	YPDA+NaCl	Yeast Extract-Peptone-Dextrose-Agar+NaCl	Peptone 10 g; Yeast extract 10 g; Dextrose 20 g; NaCl 16% (v/v); Agar 20 g; Distilled water 1 L.
