6	MRS	De Man, Rogosa, Shape	Casein peptone, tryptic digest 10.00 g; Meat extract 10.00 g; Yeast extract 5.00 g; Glucose 20.00 g; Tween 80 1.00 g; K2HPO4 2.00 g; Na-acetate 5.00 g; (NH4)3 citrate 2.00 g; MgSO4 x 7 H2O 0.20 g; MnSO4 x H2O 0.05 g; Distilled water 1000.00 ml. pH 6.2-6.5
