8	LG medium	Larpent and Larpent-Gourgaud medium	Peptone 10 g; Yeast extract 5 g; Glucose 10 g; Magnesium sulphate 0,2 g; Manganese sulphate 0,05 g; Agar 8 g; Distilled water 1 L. After sterilization in autoclave add: 25% (v/v) of apple juice sterilized by filtration and 50 mL/L of L-Cysteine ​​Hydrochloride (1g/100mL solution at pH 4.8)
